00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.000
Whitney Hodges: Yeah.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:14.000
judysmith: PDF for, uh… you know, availability of wedding events, and then, uh… yeah, okay, so no, and then we'll go to the…

00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:10.000
Whitney Hodges: Perfect.

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:25.000
judysmith: Uh, lead lock for the calendar for tours. Is that correct? Okay. All right. Okay. Got it. Okay.

00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:23.000
Whitney Hodges: Exactly. Mm-hmm. Yep. Mm-hmm.

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:47.000
Whitney Hodges: And so then I think the other thing that I want to make sure that we're kind of continuing to move on to get LeadLock launched for you sooner than later is the email and text nurture sequence. So I know that I think Danielle and Tina had shared that with you. I know you kind of had some feedback on like you felt like it was maybe a little bit too much, a little bit overwhelming.

