judysmith: Yeah, I don't think I had any problems with the wording.

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:44.000
Whitney Hodges: Okay, perfect. Yeah, so let me just… I'll share my screen, that way we can just kind of, like, talk through, like, bigger picture, kind of, like, what the content looks like, right? Because we do have… we have an email that's immediately sent to people once they inquire.

00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:29.000
