00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.000
judysmith: Yeah.

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:37.000
judysmith: Mm-hmm.

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:39.000
judysmith: Right.

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:44.000
judysmith: Mm-hmm.

