Whitney Hodges: Yeah, I feel like there's some things that I would normally see in here, and maybe they've just…

00:20:59.000 --> 00:21:04.000
Whitney Hodges: updated how this is laid out since I was last on here. Let's see.

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:37.000
Whitney Hodges: So are you… were you saying that you think that maybe you have two, um, Google Analytics accounts?

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:36.000
